##grflangid 0x01
STR_GRF_NAME :Romanian stations
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION :Set of nice Romania-inspired passenger railway stations.

STR_PARAM_METAL_ROOF_RECOLOR :Station roof colour
STR_PARAM_METAL_ROOF_RECOLOR_DESC :Colour of the metallic station roofs. By default, the colour is set to the company colour.

STR_PARAM_PLATFORM_ALTERNATE :Alternate platform sides of one-platform stations
STR_PARAM_PLATFORM_ALTERNATE_DESC :If this setting is on, building one-platform stations will make the platform side (top or bottom) of the tiles to alternate through the tracks built in one go.

STR_PARAM_COLOUR_COMPANY :Company colour
STR_PARAM_COLOUR_DARK_BLUE :Dark blue
